          "ranges": [
            [
              196,
              217
            ],
            [
              237,
              251
            ],
            [
              291,
              301
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "limits": "同一家族不同分支，不拆成新参考；addFreshEntity成功仍未实测。",
      "new_reference_credit": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "finding": "特殊箭RGB为三个自定义SynchedEntityData字段，setColors只写这三项；client拖尾消费RGB。并非原生Arrow的ID_EFFECT_COLOR。",
