      "id": "A08",
      "finding": "EntitySpellArrow重写getAddEntityPacket使用NetworkHooks；Neo47.1.64 NetworkHooks将PlayMessages.SpawnEntity封为PLAY_TO_CLIENT。不能直接套B09原生Projectile的owner runtime ID字段。",
